      "description": "Today we're joined by BlazeTV’s Hilary Kennedy to discuss all kinds of weird occult products and shows popping up specifically for young people. First, a \"Christian\" ouija board for sale on Amazon promises to connect people with God. Psalm-themed tarot cards, marketed as \"affirmation cards,\" are als",
